flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Enter numbers separated by spaces/]
    B --> C[Split input into values]
    C --> D[Create empty list for unique values]
    D --> E[Check each value]
    E --> F{Already seen?}
    F -- No --> G[Add value to unique list and set]
    F -- Yes --> H[Skip duplicate]
    G --> I{More values?}
    H --> I
    I -- Yes --> E
    I -- No --> J[/Display unique values/]
    J --> K([Stop])
